# The window's hero still, once per theme: Documents on the left, full of
# kinds of files, the photos on the right with two marked, and Places with
# ada's favorites. No docked viewer: in the window it still paints a photo
# with the terminal's half-blocks (image-ansi) instead of the photo itself.
run Documents
wait 2
keys Tab
keys Home
open
# ada's home is .., Documents, Downloads, Music, Photos, projects.
keys Home Down Down Down Down
open
keys Down
open
wait 2
# Tromsø is .., aurora-001, aurora-002, aurora-003, fjord.
keys Down Down
keys Insert
keys Insert
keys Up Up Up
keys M-b
# A shell under the panes, in the photos' folder, asking where the space went.
keys C-M-s
wait 2
type du -sh ~/*
keys Enter
wait 2
shot panes
